{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:173231c5f0650214","name":"Noble Talent Trees","source":{"id":"source:reference-173231c5f0650214","title":"Noble Talent Trees","revision":18388,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:03:27Z","sha256":"68ba0dac701ddec6e76f4df301d79eac088557a9ecfda93d20668013f4ea3f32","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18388","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Noble%20Talent%20Trees&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-173231c5f0650214","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At every odd-numbered level (1st, 3rd, 5th, and so on), a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," gains an additional Noble Talent. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," may choose a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," from any of the following Noble Talent Trees they wish, but they must meet the prerequisites (if any) of the chosen Noble Talent. No ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," can be selected more than once unless expressly indicated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Influence Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Influence_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:c995726a33a2e905"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["One of your greatest strengths is your ability to exert influence over your opponents.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Inspiration Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Inspiration_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:066f065bb50f22ec"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Nobles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nobles"}," are renowned for their ability to inspire their followers and urge them to greatness. You can often get results out of their friends, allies, and followers that other leaders cannot.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Leadership Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Leadership_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:a51a0918ead13923"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["A born leader, you know how to take charge and lead your companions and followers to success.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Lineage Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lineage_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:9d6af76576dc4c6e"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You lead a privileged life and reap the benefit of an upbringing beyond most citizens of the galaxy.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Fencing Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fencing_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:a7f90205a0555dc1"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["In the days of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic_Era"},", the fine art of swordplay was stylish among ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nobles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nobles"},". A particular style arose mixing martial precision with forceful panache.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Ideologue Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ideologue_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:bb76ea51a647902d"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Your zeal and dedication to your cause is inspirational. It motivates your allies and demoralizes your enemies.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Disgrace Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disgrace_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:934cf1fece146b2a"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Scandal fouls your family name, forcing you to live among the fringes of society and teaching you that honor is overrated when victory is on the line.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Collaborator Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collaborator_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:787d8ddd234b2211"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Some ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nobles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nobles"}," learn to work both sides of the conflict in war and can manipulate their enemies into believing they are allies.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Loyal Protector Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Loyal_Protector_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:d367be0b60ec7a18"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["As a result of your station, occupation, or even just your natural charisma, you can attract one or more faithful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," who protect you from harm.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Provocateur Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Provocateur_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:28d6eb32d25b79b0"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["As a provocateur, you specialize in turning your enemies against one another, giving your allies the advantage. This is accomplished through a combination of gaining an enemy's confidence, making careful use of deception, and coordinating your allies' attacks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Gambling Leader Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gambling_Leader_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:4a49b4d70635ec33"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You aren't afraid to take chances when leading your allies, and you risk defeat in exchange for a shot at even the most unlikely victories. You put yourself on the front lines to encourage your allies to overcome long odds.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Anticipation Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Anticipation_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:c73ad2daad3e0d8b"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You have studied the ways of your enemies and have learned how to read the actions and thoughts of others. You can predict what they will do, and you gain advantage over them by anticipating their every move.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Master of Intrigue Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Master_of_Intrigue_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:7df077580570cb24"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You are a skilled manipulator and have mastered the art of working behind the scenes to accomplish your goals. Flash and spectacle are inferior tools, only suitable for those without your unique talents.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:7042cd72401e10bc"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You excel at complex tasks and are always called upon when your allies need something done quickly and done right.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Superior Skills Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Superior_Skills_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:e4795623e8afa68f"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You're not just good at what you do, you're the best. Failure is but a stumbling block, and great success always follows.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Exile Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exile_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:dc1e1b049a5ab30c"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You have broken with your family, world, or organization and adapted in new ways to the galaxy at large.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
